Package: uniLM
Title: Unified Framework Robust Linear Models
Version: 0.1.1
Authors@R: 
    c(
    person("Laetitia", "Fritz", , "leablahout@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Sarah", "Dvorak", , "sarah@dvoraks.at", role = c("aut"))
    )
Description: Unified framework for robust linear regression centered around the minmax 
             Median-of-Neans method proposed by Lecué and Lerasle (2020), to provide both 
             a robust point estimate with bootstrapped variance, as well as an 
             outlier-detection diagnostic tool.
